    "Name": "Lindworm LND-B",
    "Details": "The B configuration of the Lindworm OmniProtoMech is completely focused on producing the maximum amount of missile damage with an SRM-5 launcher. Tests have shown that it should also be very effective against enemy vehicles, especially when it fires Inferno SRM missiles. The energy and weight requirements of its Electric Discharge ProtoMech Armor make the Lindworm unsuitable for energy weapons, which is why this is one of only two configurations that truly focus on damage output.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: OmniProtoMech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.986</color></b>",
